<!doctype lake><title>Deterministic Inference</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><section class="lake-revised-section"><h1 data-lake-id="koWaG" id="koWaG" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7d993eee" id="u7d993eee">🦊</span><span data-lake-id="u9f55c543" id="u9f55c543"> 𝐃𝐞𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐚𝐜𝐫𝐨𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐨𝐫 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐥 𝐒𝐢𝐳𝐞𝐬 𝐓𝐡𝐚𝐭 𝐄𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐬 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠–𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐌𝐢𝐬𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐜𝐡</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u021b0652" id="u021b0652"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b4dde4f" id="u0b4dde4f">大语言模型的可复现性要求生成过程具备确定性：相同输入和随机种子下，即使系统配置或执行次数变化，模型也应产生一致输出。确定性对以下三个应用场景尤为重要</span></strong></p><ul list="u618f9843"><li fid="uf5795683" data-lake-id="udc195f70" id="udc195f70"><span data-lake-id="u01f35432" id="u01f35432">首先，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue40b32d7" id="ue40b32d7">基于大语言模型的评估（LLM-as-a-Judge）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u78970669" id="u78970669">，即使用大语言模型作为评估器，对其他模型的输出质量进行评价。如果评估模型对相同输入产生不一致的评价结果，模型之间的性能比较将失去可靠性</span></li><li fid="uf5795683" data-lake-id="u2c782088" id="u2c782088"><span data-lake-id="u2f952e3b" id="u2f952e3b">其次，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua273287f" id="ua273287f">多智能体系统（Multi-Agent Systems）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u19b403e2" id="u19b403e2">，即多个大语言模型协同完成同一任务。在此类系统中，单个模型的非确定性行为可能沿着智能体之间的交互过程不断传播，导致整个系统产生不同的执行轨迹，并显著增加问题调试的难度</span></li><li fid="uf5795683" data-lake-id="u019c4ae1" id="u019c4ae1"><span data-lake-id="u76925446" id="u76925446">最后，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8824b2bb" id="u8824b2bb">基于大语言模型的强化学习</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua230de57" id="ua230de57">，其训练与采样过程通常采用不同的计算框架，例如全分片数据并行和 vLLM，并使用不同的系统配置，例如不同的张量并行规模。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2556bb53" id="u2556bb53" style="color: #DF2A3F">训练引擎与采样引擎计算得到的概率分布之间可能存在显著差异。这种差异不仅会影响模型的学习过程，还可能使原本属于同策略强化学习的训练过程表现出类似离策略强化学习的特征</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubfeeaa2d" id="ubfeeaa2d" style="text-align: center"><card data-asset="assets/7405c890168ba69d6fbc39be1fec8a1d.png" type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1795261450675-7c20bf45-df49-415a-8853-480fc7183d72.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufd6317c9-e47f-4244-90d7-9d9183a3906%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7af56495-850d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A703.63%2C%22height%22%3A300.05%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A141510%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1371%2C%22originHeight%22%3A584%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FSDPFORWARDPROBABILITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A872%2C%22y%22%3A542%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RAININGSYSTEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A684%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FSDPFORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A517%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VLLMROLLOUTTOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A541%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VLLMROLLOUTPROBABILITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A547%2C%22y%22%3A541%2C%22width%22%3A245%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROLLOUTSYSTEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A193%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKENLNDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A1071%2C%22y%22%3A271%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%28FSDPTP%3D1%29%22%2C%22x%22%3A693%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VLLM%2CTP%3D8%29%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESPONSES%22%2C%22x%22%3A455%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALTERNATIVEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1044%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTORMODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A688%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OLICYMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VLLMROLLOUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A319%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODELFORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTERNATIVEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1037%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTERNATIVELY%22%2C%22x%22%3A1006%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOSS%26BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A674%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A923%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A13%2C%22height%22%3A148%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODESTEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A223%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPT3%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPT2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XPONENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A871%2C%22y%22%3A405%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHICH%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A467%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPT1E%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHICH%22%2C%22x%22%3A245%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A919%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A167%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8062%25%E4%B8%8037%22%2C%22x%22%3A549%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22200030004000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1052%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HICH%22%2C%22x%22%3A229%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8045%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A1097%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2240%25%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A1179%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1219%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SSINCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1245%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIMILAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A397%2C%22y%22%3A405%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8051%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A1054%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2241%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A447%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8031%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2253%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2245%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A993%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8056%25%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A586%2C%22y%22%3A444%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SINCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A851%2C%22y%22%3A467%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8065%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A318%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A784%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A552%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2243%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LET%22%2C%22x%22%3A186%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1161%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A465%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A623%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DID%22%2C%22x%22%3A708%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IS%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LET%22%2C%22x%22%3A312%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%803%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A1253%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BU%E5%84%BFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A961%2C%22y%22%3A469%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A225%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f4f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u66471c8c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2aac9f11" id="u2aac9f11"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e8b4479" id="u7e8b4479">确定性仍然是当前大语言模型系统普遍缺失的重要属性。即使采用贪心解码，仅改变 Batch Size 或 TP Size 等系统配置，也可能导致模型对相同输入生成不同的输出。在 AIME 数据集上，这种差异甚至可能导致高达 9% 的准确率波动</span></strong></p><ul list="u3664b783"><li fid="ube2896ff" data-lake-id="uef6e87fe" id="uef6e87fe"><span data-lake-id="u1c0b0672" id="u1c0b0672">造成上述现象的根本原因在于，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b3091b3" id="u1b3091b3">浮点数运算不满足结合律</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud94fd153" id="ud94fd153">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe2b6a29" id="ufe2b6a29" style="color: #004347">由于浮点计算存在舍入误差，不同的计算顺序可能产生不同的数值结果。在大语言模型推理服务系统中，这种计算顺序的差异可能来源于多个方面，包括连续批处理、张量并行等并行计算策略，以及不同的计算内核实现</span></strong></li><li fid="ube2896ff" data-lake-id="uf2ac916b" id="uf2ac916b"><span data-lake-id="u2ec0011b" id="u2ec0011b">He &amp; Lab 提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa628fcb" id="uaa628fcb">批次不变运算</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4748918a" id="u4748918a">，包括具有批次不变性的 FlexAttention、RMSNorm 和矩阵乘法内核，从而保证推理结果不随 Batch Size 的变化而改变。这一技术目前主要用于消除 Batch Size 变化引起的数值差异。还有许多其他因素同样会造成非确定性，而且这些因素往往更加难以控制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0ece68c2" id="u0ece68c2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b4674ef" id="u7b4674ef" style="color: #70000D">旨在实现完全确定性的大语言模型推理，并保证强化学习流程中的采样引擎与训练引擎在数值上实现逐位一致。研究发现，张量并行是造成推理非确定性的重要来源之一，也是当前尚未得到有效解决的关键问题。因此，消除不同 TP Size 所引入的数值差异，是实现完全确定性推理所需解决的最后一个关键环节</span></strong></p><ul list="ua556c44a"><li fid="u9b0b0b17" data-lake-id="u350ed9f5" id="u350ed9f5">本文通过<strong>统一跨 GPU 的数值累加顺序</strong>，提出<strong>基于树结构的不变计算内核</strong>，使不同 TP Size 下的矩阵乘法与归约遵循一致顺序，实现确定性推理及 vLLM 与 FSDP 间的逐位一致</li><li fid="u9b0b0b17" data-lake-id="u7f67aae9" id="u7f67aae9">研究分析不同 TP Size 的数值非确定性及其对评估与强化学习的影响，通过固定 GPU 内矩阵乘法与 GPU 间 All-Reduce 的计算顺序消除差异。TBIK 集成至 vLLM 和 FSDP 后，不同配置的推理结果逐位一致，<strong>消除训练与采样的概率分布差异，支持同策略强化学习</strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="YFztW" id="YFztW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3dd99bce" id="u3dd99bce">🐶</span><span data-lake-id="ufeb6b078" id="ufeb6b078"> 𝐈𝐄𝐄𝐄 𝟕𝟓𝟒 𝐅𝐏 𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐍𝐨𝐧-𝐀𝐬𝐬𝐨𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0cce8950" id="u0cce8950"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34a901a2" id="u34a901a2" style="color: #DF2A3F">IEEE 754 浮点运算存在一个广为人知的数值特性，即浮点加法不满足结合律（Non-Associativity），其数学表达形式为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u62c2242a" id="u62c2242a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%28a%2Bb%29%2Bc%5C%5Cneq%20a%2B%28b%2Bc%29%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F661d2299bf6f85441067d80fd676fde0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vxCIj%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4d95f7c3"><li fid="u69341e27" data-lake-id="ua0ea15d3" id="ua0ea15d3"><span data-lake-id="u68e38ff4" id="u68e38ff4">这一特性意味着，由于浮点运算过程中存在舍入误差，不同的数值累加顺序可能产生不同的最终计算结果。因此，即使数学表达式在实数运算意义下完全等价，其对应的浮点计算结果也可能存在差异</span></li><li fid="u69341e27" data-lake-id="uc8d3f7c3" id="uc8d3f7c3"><span data-lake-id="ua119e95b" id="ua119e95b">针对这一问题，已有研究从算法与系统两个层面提出多种缓解措施。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd1a894d" id="ucd1a894d">融合乘加运算（Fused Multiply-Add，FMA）能够对 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x*y%2Bz%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F127caf3877cb1a5aa2893c906bac8f19.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L8jpi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f9ac30d" id="u1f9ac30d"> 进行计算：首先以双倍长度的精度精确计算乘积，然后执行加法，并仅在最终结果中进行一次舍入</span></strong></li><li fid="u69341e27" data-lake-id="u5c15ebaf" id="u5c15ebaf"><span data-lake-id="u25ac9c23" id="u25ac9c23">在矩阵乘法和 Flash-Attention 等计算内核中，一种常见做法是采用 FP32 累加器执行中间结果的归约运算，以减轻低精度浮点计算带来的数值误差。此外，Softmax、RMSNorm 和 RoPE 等常用算子也通常默认采用 FP32 精度执行相关计算，以提高数值计算的稳定性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5df3e6f2" id="u5df3e6f2"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf8545d88" id="uf8545d88">现代大语言模型推理服务系统中，多种因素均可能改变浮点运算的执行顺序，进而影响最终数值结果，导致推理过程出现非确定性。主要包括以下六个方面</span></strong></p><ul list="u7e63eae3"><li fid="ufb2441b5" data-lake-id="ufbc0ac08" id="ufbc0ac08"><span data-lake-id="u0a8b92dd" id="u0a8b92dd">连续批处理允许推理服务系统动态调整同一批次中的请求集合及其 Batch Size。由于不同批次配置可能改变计算任务的组织方式和执行顺序，因此可能导致相同输入在不同运行环境下产生不一致的数值结果</span></li><li fid="ufb2441b5" data-lake-id="ue3885f59" id="ue3885f59"><span data-lake-id="u9dbf6662" id="u9dbf6662">相同运算的内核可能采用不同归约方式。Split-K MatMul 将归约维度分块，分别计算并合并部分和；若合并顺序受线程调度影响，结果可能不确定</span></li><li fid="ufb2441b5" data-lake-id="u01368bcc" id="u01368bcc"><span data-lake-id="ud40fd50c" id="ud40fd50c">MatMul 与 Flash-Attention 的 Block Size 会改变数据分块及内核累加顺序，即使输入与参数不变，也可能产生不同的浮点结果</span></li><li fid="ufb2441b5" data-lake-id="uc6a1d0b3" id="uc6a1d0b3"><span data-lake-id="u42d34c06" id="u42d34c06">多 GPU 通过 All-Reduce 聚合局部结果时，归约顺序可能变化。浮点加法不满足结合律，因此相同的局部结果也可能得到不同的最终数值</span></li><li fid="ufb2441b5" data-lake-id="u343078d8" id="u343078d8"><span data-lake-id="u4a85701c" id="u4a85701c">张量并行等策略将计算任务分配至多个 GPU，改变原始计算的组织方式。不同 TP 配置对应不同的计算划分与跨设备聚合过程，改变 TP Size 可能引入不同的浮点运算顺序，影响模型输出的数值一致性</span></li><li fid="ufb2441b5" data-lake-id="ue3243c87" id="ue3243c87"><span data-lake-id="u6215ce00" id="u6215ce00">不同 GPU 架构可能采用不同的底层指令执行相同的数值计算，例如 NVIDIA Hopper 的矩阵乘法可以使用 WGMMA。由于各架构的指令与计算实现存在差异，相同的矩阵乘法也可能产生不同的浮点结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubab8e083" id="ubab8e083"><strong><span data-lake-id="u00a2dfd9" id="u00a2dfd9" style="color: #5C0036">综上所述，浮点运算的非结合性使大语言模型的推理结果对计算顺序具有敏感性，而现代推理系统中的动态批处理、算子实现、内核超参数、集合通信、并行策略及硬件架构差异，均可能改变这一顺序。即使采用贪心解码，不同的 Batch Size、GPU 架构及 TP 配置仍可能导致模型推理输出出现显著差异。这些现象表明，实现大语言模型推理的完全确定性，不仅需要控制随机采样过程，还需要保证底层浮点运算在不同系统配置下具有一致的计算顺序</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="MEzC2" id="MEzC2" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub3b2c53a" id="ub3b2c53a">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="u330381d6" id="u330381d6" style="color: #5C0036"> </span><span data-lake-id="uf8e4d8ec" id="uf8e4d8ec">𝐌𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ucb033832" id="ucb033832"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e875bb1" id="u8e875bb1">计算过程中的非确定性会对多种大语言模型应用产生影响。以目前广泛采用的基于大语言模型的强化学习为例，进一步分析数值非确定性对模型训练过程的影响。以 REINFORCE 算法为例。该算法通过以下方式更新策略 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YXHFU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u64bbb816" id="u64bbb816" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleftarrow%20%5C%5Ctheta%2B%5C%5Cmu%5C%5Ccdot%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Ba%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi%28%5C%5Ctheta%29%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brollout%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BR%28a%29%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi%28a%2C%5C%5Ctheta%29%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btraining%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Febfe7964754e2bfaac3c950737c4c935.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AK07G%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u11be9579"><li fid="u45903ad7" data-lake-id="u84f83dd3" id="u84f83dd3"><span data-lake-id="ud5635934" id="ud5635934">在实际系统中，Rollout 通常由 vLLM、SGLang 等推理引擎执行，而模型训练则采用独立的训练后端，例如 FSDP。这种混合式系统架构使策略更新过程实际上变为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u043c02b4" id="u043c02b4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleftarrow%20%5C%5Ctheta%2B%5C%5Cmu%5C%5Ccdot%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Ba%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brollout%7D%7D%28%5C%5Ctheta%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnR%28a%29%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blearner%7D%7D%28a%2C%5C%5Ctheta%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1845f10f70d87d7fb4448c7a3de589bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B21dt%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud1501f12"><li fid="u70a6dea8" data-lake-id="u1e060c90" id="u1e060c90"><span data-lake-id="u562b56d9" id="u562b56d9">即使采样策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brollout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa7623e9f41c3e03b7a1cc53f3cf15c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q4zQ8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc609003e" id="uc609003e"> 与训练策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blearner%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0d868490ff94a3c8fa76310dcb3f6b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bZgQv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f17da8f" id="u8f17da8f"> 共享完全相同的模型参数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uBMUl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7497d499" id="u7497d499">，不同计算框架的 Kernel 实现及系统配置仍可能导致两者计算得到的概率存在显著差异。这种概率不一致会使原本的同策略更新在实际执行过程中隐式转变为离策略更新，从而破坏训练稳定性，并对模型收敛过程及最终策略性能产生负面影响</span></li><li fid="u70a6dea8" data-lake-id="uf614f8a7" id="uf614f8a7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uda56d022" id="uda56d022" style="color: #4C16B1">值得注意的是，与稠密模型相比，这一问题在混合专家模型中可能更加严重。这是因为，即使概率计算中仅存在微小的数值扰动，也可能改变 Router 的路由决策，使 Token 被分配至完全不同的专家网络，进而放大训练与推理之间的差异</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubafb994a" id="ubafb994a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0116a74d" id="u0116a74d">为缓解大语言模型推理过程中的非确定性问题，He &amp; Lab 提出批次不变运算，包括具有批次不变性的 FlexAttention、RMSNorm 和 MatMul Kernel，使模型推理结果能够在不同 Batch Size 下保持一致。BIO 的核心思想是沿 Batch 维度并行组织计算，使不同样本独立执行，从而保证每个样本的数值归约顺序不受 Batch Size 变化的影响</span></strong></p><ul list="u6086fb32"><li fid="ud7c68286" data-lake-id="ue08190d3" id="ue08190d3"><span data-lake-id="u7beb8f80" id="u7beb8f80">具体而言，在 RMSNorm 中，每个 Batch 元素由单个计算核心独立处理，使特征维度上的归约运算不再依赖跨计算核心通信。在 MatMul 中，每个计算核心负责计算一个二维 Tile 对应的矩阵乘法，并在本地完成全部归约过程，即采用 Non-Split-K 策略，从而避免不同计算任务之间的归约顺序变化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud9ef15be" id="ud9ef15be"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e6fc9c2" id="u4e6fc9c2">Batch Invariance 只是实现完全确定性推理的第一步。除 Batch Size 外，仍有许多因素可能导致数值非确定性，其中最重要的因素与模型并行策略密切相关。为进一步分析这一问题，首先介绍大语言模型推理系统中最常见的三类并行策略，并讨论 BIO 在不同并行配置下的表现</span></strong></p><ul list="u0deffc84"><li fid="u7b796f41" data-lake-id="u196d5c3d" id="u196d5c3d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f3502d1" id="u0f3502d1">数据并行：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u121dc408" id="u121dc408"> 在数据并行模式下，每个 GPU 均持有完整的模型副本，但分别处理 Batch 中不同的样本子集，相当于沿 Batch Size 维度划分计算任务。因此，改变 DP 并行度本质上等价于改变每个 GPU 所处理的 Batch Size。由于 BIO 能够保证单个样本的计算顺序不受 Batch Size 影响，因此在不同 DP 配置下，推理结果仍能够保持一致</span></li><li fid="u7b796f41" data-lake-id="ufef67392" id="ufef67392"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0d1e88e" id="uf0d1e88e">流水线并行：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u030e802d" id="u030e802d"> 在流水线并行模式下，模型的不同网络层被分配至多个 GPU 或计算节点，这也是跨节点模型并行的默认策略。前一阶段产生的中间激活值会依次传递至下一阶段，直至完成整个模型的前向计算。由于改变 PP 并行度并不会改变各网络层内部的计算顺序，因此不会影响推理结果的确定性</span></li><li fid="u7b796f41" data-lake-id="u494cf0e6" id="u494cf0e6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e4110f9" id="u7e4110f9">张量并行：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucabc1536" id="ucabc1536"> 在张量并行模式下，每一层的权重矩阵被划分至多个 GPU，不同 GPU 分别执行局部计算，并通过聚合各设备上的部分结果得到该层的完整输出。TP 是大语言模型推理服务系统中默认采用的节点内并行策略。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e18b9ac" id="u9e18b9ac" style="color: #DF2A3F">与 DP 和 PP 不同，改变 TP 配置可能直接改变模型的计算顺序，从而导致推理输出发生变化。BIO 并不能有效消除由 TP Size 变化引入的数值差异</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufa8474b5" id="ufa8474b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u443fd69a" id="u443fd69a" style="color: #AE146E">张量并行在大语言模型推理系统中被广泛使用，其并行规模通常需要根据实际部署环境和吞吐性能要求进行调整。因此，不同系统之间的 TP Size 不一致并非罕见现象。这一问题在强化学习训练流程中尤为突出：Rollout 引擎通常采用较大的 TP Size，以最大化推理吞吐量；而训练引擎则往往采用不同的并行策略，例如使用 TP=1 的 FSDP，以提高显存利用效率。因此，如何在不同 TP Size 下保证模型计算结果的一致性，是实现训练与推理数值对齐的重要挑战</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="sgVX7" id="sgVX7" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0ce90727" id="u0ce90727">🐶</span><span data-lake-id="u483c743f" id="u483c743f"> 𝐖𝐡𝐲 𝐁𝐈𝐎 𝐅𝐚𝐢𝐥 𝐔𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐫 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐓𝐏 𝐒𝐢𝐳𝐞𝐬?</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u751faa4d" id="u751faa4d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa10f54e" id="ufa10f54e">vLLM 中的 Transformer 模型通常采用两种互补的张量并行方式：列并行（Column Parallelism）与行并行（Row Parallelism）。其中，自注意力模块中的 QKV Projection，以及前馈网络（Feed-Forward Network，FFN）中的 Up Projection 和 Gate Projection，通常采用列并行实现，由不同 GPU 分别计算一部分输出特征</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ufadac549" id="ufadac549" style="text-align: center"><card data-asset="assets/a92db36428a15680a7edb51f67c05798.png" type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1795262692055-f11756b7-5daa-4883-a137-8ef0d18637e1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub1e14ed4-767a-49e1-b3a7-c17794abc65%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubb57aa9f-f662-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A776.05%2C%22height%22%3A267.75%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A135176%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1553%2C%22originHeight%22%3A536%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERDECODERLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A495%2C%22width%22%3A375%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-HEADATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A233%2C%22y%22%3A436%2C%22width%22%3A220%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MHEADLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1215%2C%22y%22%3A494%2C%22width%22%3A195%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEEDFORWARDNETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A771%2C%22y%22%3A438%2C%22width%22%3A248%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EADDIMXEE%22%2C%22x%22%3A142%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%2FUPPROJDOWNPROJ%22%2C%22x%22%3A774%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HIDDEM_DIM%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OCAB_SIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1229%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%28WXOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A751%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QKVPRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LM_HEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1248%2C%22y%22%3A382%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TPSIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1240%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TPSIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A735%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TP_SIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A229%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GWN%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPROJ%22%2C%22x%22%3A365%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AW%22%2C%22x%22%3A755%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WA%22%2C%22x%22%3A900%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%E5%91%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1258%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A1060%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1357%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2201%22%2C%22x%22%3A981%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WW%22%2C%22x%22%3A235%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A565%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WG%22%2C%22x%22%3A891%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QN%22%2C%22x%22%3A761%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WO%22%2C%22x%22%3A399%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7ddd0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u20c39115%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua06b9226" id="ua06b9226"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc485406e" id="uc485406e">列并行矩阵乘法：在列并行模式下，权重矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BK%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c7fb9a4c447df7fb702fba4bb072081.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z9P8L%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u954d7023" id="u954d7023">沿输出维度划分为 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K0dNn%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13f22da1" id="u13f22da1"> 个子矩阵，其中 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yZeFJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b28ca27" id="u1b28ca27"> 表示参与张量并行的 GPU 数量</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3d684da5" id="u3d684da5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BK%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cfrac%7BN%7D%7BC%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CC.%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc3b487eb5c3b07510c59978e4504070e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MUxso%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u48517dea"><li fid="ufe4fb029" data-lake-id="u3ce318be" id="u3ce318be"><span data-lake-id="ucc0f873d" id="ucc0f873d">每个 GPU 独立计算对应的局部矩阵乘法结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2834115c" id="u2834115c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O_i%3DXW_i%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5CnO_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BM%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cfrac%7BN%7D%7BC%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa162370656430b7416e5ee1667c1726d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wUMJo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ude4c833a"><li fid="u033a6530" data-lake-id="u9c584e9b" id="u9c584e9b"><span data-lake-id="uc205be65" id="uc205be65">最终，通过拼接各 GPU 上的局部输出得到完整结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uceef28f1" id="uceef28f1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%3DXW%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5CnXW_1%20%26%20XW_2%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%20XW_C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb193dd1aa65ff35bc09c6fa947f92862.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v6uZT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua7aca3ce"><li fid="ubb2bd089" data-lake-id="u0c49bc86" id="u0c49bc86"><span data-lake-id="u7991785d" id="u7991785d">由于各 GPU 对应的输出分块相互独立，整个过程不需要沿共享归约维度对不同设备的结果进行累加。因此，改变 TP Size 通常不会影响列并行矩阵乘法的数值输出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u155d6ca6" id="u155d6ca6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5393a9d0" id="u5393a9d0">行并行矩阵乘法：与列并行不同，自注意力模块中的 O Projection，以及 FFN 中的 Down Projection，通常采用行并行实现。在行并行模式下，输入矩阵 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nyAqi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u24c8c8e6" id="u24c8c8e6"> 沿列维度切分，权重矩阵 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22itiF5%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub49cfd7c" id="ub49cfd7c"> 则沿行维度切分，使每个 GPU 分别持有</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6422055a" id="u6422055a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BM%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cfrac%7BK%7D%7BC%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5CnW_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7BK%7D%7BC%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CC.%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab4f875ccee841658c5a85108d0f6509.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BuV0a%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uab8755b8"><li fid="uaa33be3a" data-lake-id="ubaf3afe9" id="ubaf3afe9"><span data-lake-id="u75acbca3" id="u75acbca3">每个 GPU 首先计算局部矩阵乘法 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_iW_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe925bc1b94e77b7b60be9708c54dc967.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bXumh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3665a14a" id="u3665a14a">，随后通过对所有 GPU 的局部计算结果求和，得到最终输出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u953a6d25" id="u953a6d25" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22XW%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BC%7DX_iW_i.%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6ea92091dc9b6e1244a23e10a3e9173.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yhYX6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud3fb5f2c"><li fid="u02422160" data-lake-id="uca23960c" id="uca23960c"><span data-lake-id="ufeeb6860" id="ufeeb6860">All-Reduce 聚合各 GPU 的部分结果，输出因此受到浮点求和顺序影响。在 Transformer 中，列并行层（如 Up Projection）的输出通常直接传给行并行层（如 Down Projection）</span></li></ul><figure class="lake-image-pair" style="width:85%;max-width:860px;margin:20px auto;--lake-pair-ratio-total:4.4894"><span class="lake-image-panel" style="--lake-panel-ratio:2.2447"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tp-column-diagram%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E5%88%97%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E4%B9%98%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22width%22%3A400%2C%22height%22%3A178%2C%22originWidth%22%3A798%2C%22originHeight%22%3A711%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C0.5%5D%7D" data-asset="assets/eab4aa1fc6629fd3ec5ca45817b0f077.png"></card></span><span class="lake-image-panel" style="--lake-panel-ratio:2.2447"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tp-row-diagram%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E8%A1%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E4%B9%98%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22width%22%3A400%2C%22height%22%3A178%2C%22originWidth%22%3A798%2C%22originHeight%22%3A711%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0.5%2C1%2C1%5D%7D" data-asset="assets/eab4aa1fc6629fd3ec5ca45817b0f077.png"></card></span></figure><p data-lake-id="u7620df29" id="u7620df29"><strong><span data-lake-id="u56dd99f1" id="u56dd99f1">由于列并行天然沿特征维度划分输出，这些分块能够直接由后续行并行层使用，无需额外的跨设备同步。然而，行并行线性层通常位于自注意力模块和 FFN 模块的末端，因此必须通过 All-Reduce 聚合所有 GPU 的局部计算结果，才能获得当前模块的完整输出</span></strong></p><ul list="u10af6708"><li fid="u7520a82f" data-lake-id="uf744b46f" id="uf744b46f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6460062" id="uf6460062">改变 TP Size 会改变行并行矩阵乘法的归约顺序。</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u95a0b3b1" id="u95a0b3b1" style="color: #DF2A3F">对于列并行层，不同 GPU 计算的输出相互独立，因此改变 TP Size 不会影响共享维度上的累加过程。然而，对于行并行层，输入矩阵 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ddEe5%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3bc3f7ad" id="u3bc3f7ad" style="color: #DF2A3F"> 和权重矩阵 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22acGJv%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucea90798" id="ucea90798" style="color: #DF2A3F"> 均沿归约维度 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kfi84%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0398ede" id="uf0398ede" style="color: #DF2A3F"> 被划分至多个 GPU。每个 GPU 分别计算一个大小为 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5C%5Ctimes%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcdbe4f851f1a68b3e0c6b28422f63f30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22atAkS%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4b7f3d50" id="u4b7f3d50" style="color: #DF2A3F"> 的局部结果，随后通过跨设备逐元素归约操作聚合所有局部结果</span></strong></li><li fid="u7520a82f" data-lake-id="u52faca1c" id="u52faca1c"><span data-lake-id="u4d3a02f2" id="u4d3a02f2">即使 All-Reduce 算法本身具有确定性，参与归约的 GPU 数量发生变化时，每个输出元素对应的数值计算顺序仍可能发生改变。在使用标准 cuBLAS GEMM 执行矩阵乘法时，每个 GPU 首先沿 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sRtN4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc49a2ec2" id="uc49a2ec2"> 维度顺序执行局部归约，随后通过 NCCL 在不同 GPU 之间进一步聚合这些部分结果。因此，不同 TP Size 会改变局部归约与跨 GPU 归约的组织方式，进而改变整个矩阵乘法的浮点累加顺序。由于浮点加法不满足结合律，即使输入数据和模型参数完全一致，最终计算结果仍可能出现差异</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf4845374" id="uf4845374"><span data-lake-id="u22a690f4" id="u22a690f4">综上，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9979af2" id="ud9979af2">BIO 只能保证单个样本的计算不受 Batch Size 变化的影响，却无法保证不同 Tensor Parallel 配置下的全局浮点归约顺序一致</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u14a9a3e5" id="u14a9a3e5">。因此，仅依赖 BIO 无法实现跨 TP Size 的数值可复现性</span></p><p data-lake-id="ueae4684b" id="ueae4684b" style="text-align: center"><card data-asset="assets/5a8592c50b72352c29d3422e38e053a7.png" type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1795262847039-77d3d770-c437-4d86-bb69-0f21c2d55cc9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u18cda465-1665-46f2-8f51-ac4c5e9b7c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubb57aa9f-f662-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A818.55%2C%22height%22%3A278.8%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A192967%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1627%2C%22originHeight%22%3A554%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDMATMUL%2BALLREDUC%22%2C%22x%22%3A1160%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A287%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTER-GPUREDUCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1352%2C%22y%22%3A513%2C%22width%22%3A177%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTRA-GPUREDUCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1057%2C%22y%22%3A514%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P1PARTIALRESULT%22%2C%22x%22%3A570%2C%22y%22%3A510%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BINARYTREEBASEDMATL%22%2C%22x%22%3A968%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A286%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UBLASGEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A154%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACCUMULATOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A512%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GALLREDUCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A485%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NCCLRING%22%2C%22x%22%3A374%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226T7T%22%2C%22x%22%3A228%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2212%22%2C%22x%22%3A453%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RRESULT%22%2C%22x%22%3A844%2C%22y%22%3A511%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A1260%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPUO%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A405%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TP%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A152%2C%22y%22%3A460%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P%3D4%22%2C%22x%22%3A594%2C%22y%22%3A461%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225T6%22%2C%22x%22%3A632%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2234%22%2C%22x%22%3A1344%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T5T6%22%2C%22x%22%3A1436%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227T8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1527%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU2%22%2C%22x%22%3A1444%2C%22y%22%3A405%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU1%22%2C%22x%22%3A246%2C%22y%22%3A405%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227%22%2C%22x%22%3A727%2C%22y%22%3A366%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPUJO%22%2C%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223T4%22%2C%22x%22%3A548%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T1TILE%22%2C%22x%22%3A94%2C%22y%22%3A509%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU0%22%2C%22x%22%3A891%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1070%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PU1%22%2C%22x%22%3A553%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1532%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU2%22%2C%22x%22%3A636%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPUO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1270%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1362%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TP%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A987%2C%22y%22%3A460%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU3%22%2C%22x%22%3A723%2C%22y%22%3A405%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BB%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1278%2C%22y%22%3A335%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TP%3D4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1399%2C%22y%22%3A462%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P2%22%2C%22x%22%3A1372%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T3%22%2C%22x%22%3A524%2C%22y%22%3A370%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1555%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1267%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1459%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P2%22%2C%22x%22%3A557%2C%22y%22%3A307%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1550%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GP%22%2C%22x%22%3A532%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P3%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b09676%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub7f37ce0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="cAFy1" id="cAFy1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u44d31021" id="u44d31021">🐹</span><span data-lake-id="uecf3cfa5" id="uecf3cfa5"> 𝐓𝐫𝐞𝐞-𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐈𝐧𝐯𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐭 𝐊𝐞𝐫𝐧𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u47b45b02" id="u47b45b02"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d13e247" id="u3d13e247">为在不同 TP Size 下实现完全确定性推理，必须对 GPU 内部矩阵乘法与 GPU 间归约运算进行协同设计，确保浮点运算的全局累加顺序不随张量并行配置发生变化。基于这一思想，本文提出 TBIK，通过构建同时覆盖 GPU 内部计算与跨 GPU 通信的固定层次化归约结构，使不同并行配置遵循一致的数值累加顺序</span></strong></p><ul list="u6b0773ae"><li fid="u9728b7b4" data-lake-id="u2c7b4195" id="u2c7b4195"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5db86cf4" id="u5db86cf4">TBIK 的核心设计原则是使浮点累加顺序独立于 TP Size。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud75e4d2b" id="ud75e4d2b">具体而言，该方法在局部矩阵乘法和分布式集合通信操作中采用统一的完全二叉树归约拓扑。其中，每个矩阵乘法的部分计算结果对应二叉树的一个叶节点，而内部节点则按照预定义的树结构，对其子节点的结果执行确定性的两两累加</span></li><li fid="u9728b7b4" data-lake-id="uec61db95" id="uec61db95"><span data-lake-id="uf2603cda" id="uf2603cda">由于整个归约树的结构预先确定，且不依赖参与计算的 GPU 数量，因此不同 TP 配置均能够遵循相同的全局数值累加路径。通过固定浮点运算的执行顺序，TBIK 消除由不同并行划分方式引起的归约顺序差异，从而保证计算结果的确定性</span></li><li fid="u9728b7b4" data-lake-id="u905804f2" id="u905804f2"><strong><span data-lake-id="uba43806a" id="uba43806a" style="color: #DF2A3F">TBIK 的整体执行流程主要由两个阶段组成：GPU 内部的树形矩阵乘法归约，以及 GPU 间采用相同树结构的自定义归约操作</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueb7c64d8" id="ueb7c64d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u760f4ddd" id="u760f4ddd">GPU 内部归约：基于 Triton 实现 GPU 内部的树形归约计算，并采用分块方式执行矩阵乘法，再按预定的二叉树顺序合并各块的部分结果</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub7d51f98" id="ub7d51f98" style="text-align: center"><card data-asset="assets/b1b2dbe36d1be0b49dbb4a790a0ba924.png" type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1795263362256-702bcc35-91b0-4d49-afe9-400bc22f7cd6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uba592f94-f5e4-4468-ad39-7f8ec2f0312%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub8eee3d6-f772-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A547.4%2C%22height%22%3A272.0%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A32498%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A805%2C%22originHeight%22%3A400%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A503%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%86X0%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A504%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TREEREDUCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A532%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKM%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A77%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKM%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A298%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A67%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TREEREDUC%22%2C%22x%22%3A156%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKK%22%2C%22x%22%3A137%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKN%22%2C%22x%22%3A307%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f6f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaa3b274c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u27521a4d"><li fid="u28496c56" data-lake-id="u5a97c203" id="u5a97c203"><span data-lake-id="u9c460986" id="u9c460986">具体而言，首先沿矩阵乘法的归约维度 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LANB1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21baba93" id="u21baba93">，将输入矩阵划分为多个计算 Tile，并使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa9a1ad45a74fd7720c030b2648b091a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRovS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6da4a842" id="u6da4a842">表示该维度上的 Tile 总数。在包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l7cSI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81fcc57d" id="u81fcc57d">个 GPU 的张量并行配置下，每个 GPU 负责处理</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7BT_K%7D%7BC%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e50330bfed81767975c86135f373f8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EyOdy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u358ee840" id="u358ee840">个 Tile。为保证局部浮点累加顺序的确定性，TBIK 不再采用传统的顺序累加方式，而是将 GPU 内部的归约过程组织为固定的二叉树结构</span></li><li fid="u28496c56" data-lake-id="u03967c56" id="u03967c56"><span data-lake-id="u12fbe703" id="u12fbe703">在这一结构中，不同层级分别存储中间部分计算结果，树的深度定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%3D%5C%5Clog_2%5C%5Cfrac%7BT_K%7D%7BC%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5799ef26e410a302fb34c948fbadcee7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PJqz8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31e8cf04" id="u31e8cf04">其中，每个部分矩阵乘法结果对应一个叶节点，内部节点则按照预先定义的二叉树拓扑执行两两归约。与传统矩阵乘法中沿</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22den4O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueaa925fc" id="ueaa925fc">维度顺序累加部分结果的方式不同，树形归约通过固定的层次化累加结构，约束中间结果的组合顺序。每个计算 Tile 的部分结果均按照预定义的归约路径逐层合并，直到得到当前 GPU 对应的局部输出</span></li><li fid="u28496c56" data-lake-id="u741159a1" id="u741159a1"><span data-lake-id="u399ff6fc" id="u399ff6fc">由于该归约结构采用固定的二叉树拓扑，且其累加规则不依赖 TP Size，因此不同张量并行配置能够保持一致的局部归约顺序，并为后续跨 GPU 归约提供统一的计算基础</span></li></ul><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="tbik-matmul-algorithm"><figcaption id="tbik-matmul-algorithm"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Tree-Based MatMul Kernel</figcaption><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tbik-algorithm-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Bl%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BRequire%3A%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Matrices%20%7DA%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BM%5C%5Ctimes%20K%7D%2C%5C%5C%20B%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BK%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BBlock%20sizes%20%7DB_M%2CB_N%2CB_K%5C%5Ctext%7B%2C%20total%20tiles%20%7DT%3DK%2FB_K%5C%5Ctext%7B%2C%20first%20level%20tile%20count%20%7DK_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfirst%7D%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BReduction%20depth%20%7DL%3D%5C%5Clog_2%28T%2FK_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfirst%7D%7D%29%2B1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BEnsure%3A%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Output%20matrix%20%7DC%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BM%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20all%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20blocks%20%7D%28m%2Cn%29%5C%5Ctext%7B%20in%20grid%20%7D%28%5C%5Clceil%20M%2FB_M%5C%5Crceil%2C%5C%5Clceil%20N%2FB_N%5C%5Crceil%29%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bin%20parallel%20do%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7BInitialize%20local%20accumulator%3A%20%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%5BB_M%5D%5BB_N%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7BInitialize%20scratch%20buffers%3A%20%7DS%5BL%5D%5BB_M%5D%5BB_N%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7BInitialize%20counters%3A%20%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCount%7D%5BL%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7Dt%3D0%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bto%7D%5C%5C%20T-1%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7BLoad%20tile%20%7DA_t%3DA%5Bm%3Am%2BB_M%2C%5C%5C%20tB_K%3A%28t%2B1%29B_K%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7BLoad%20tile%20%7DB_t%3DB%5BtB_K%3A%28t%2B1%29B_K%2C%5C%5C%20n%3An%2BB_N%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%2BA_tB_t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bwhile%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%3CL%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bif%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%28%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%3D0%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCount%7D%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%2B1%3DK_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfirst%7D%7D%29%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bor%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%28%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%3E0%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCount%7D%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%2B1%3D2%29%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bthen%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%2BS%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20S%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCount%7D%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%2B1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Belse%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20S%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCount%7D%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCount%7D%5B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blevel%7D%5D%2B1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bbreak%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20if%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20while%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20C%5Bm%3Am%2BB_M%2C%5C%5C%20n%3An%2BB_N%5D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%22%7D"></card></p></figure><p data-lake-id="u293e9314" id="u293e9314"><strong><span data-lake-id="u81ca0134" id="u81ca0134">GPU 间归约：完成 GPU 内部的局部累加后，TBIK 通过自定义的 Tree-Based All-Reduce 操作，同步与聚合各 GPU 的部分结果。GPU 间归约采用与 GPU 内部矩阵乘法完全一致的二叉树拓扑结构，使局部计算与跨设备聚合共同构成统一的全局归约树</span></strong></p><ul list="u75c073cf"><li fid="u86483185" data-lake-id="u6842968f" id="u6842968f"><span data-lake-id="u46d21356" id="u46d21356">具体而言，GPU 内部首先按照固定的树结构完成局部归约，随后 GPU 间的部分结果继续按照相同的层次化规则进行两两合并。通过在两个阶段保持一致的归约拓扑，TBIK 能够保证不同 TP Size 下的全局浮点累加顺序不发生变化。这一设计避免传统矩阵乘法与 All-Reduce 组合中，由于局部计算划分和跨设备归约顺序改变而产生的数值差异</span></li><li fid="u86483185" data-lake-id="u804b72d8" id="u804b72d8"><span data-lake-id="uefb1f097" id="uefb1f097">因此，通过协同设计 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc65e5139" id="uc65e5139">Tree-Based MatMul 与 Tree-Based All-Reduce</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u109532ae" id="u109532ae">，TBIK 将 GPU 内部计算和 GPU 间通信统一到固定的二叉树归约结构之中，从而实现不同张量并行规模下的逐位一致计算结果</span></li></ul><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="tbik-allreduce-algorithm"><figcaption id="tbik-allreduce-algorithm"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> Tree-Based All-Reduce</figcaption><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tbik-algorithm-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Bl%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BRequire%3A%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Local%20tensor%20%7Dx%5C%5Ctext%7B%20on%20rank%20%7Dr%5C%5Ctext%7B%2C%20world%20size%20%7DW%3D2%5Eq%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BEnsure%3A%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20All-reduced%20tensor%20%7Dx%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%20x%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7B%2F%2F%20Reduce%20phase%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Cell%3D0%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bto%7D%5C%5C%20q-1%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20s%5C%5Cleftarrow%202%5E%5C%5Cell%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bif%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7Dr%5C%5Cbmod%202s%3D0%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bthen%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRecv%7D%28r%2Bs%29%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Belse%20if%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7Dr%5C%5Cbmod%202s%3Ds%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bthen%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSend%7D%28%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%2Cr-s%29%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bbreak%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20if%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7B%2F%2F%20Broadcast%20phase%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Cell%3Dq-1%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdown%20to%7D%5C%5C%200%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20s%5C%5Cleftarrow%202%5E%5C%5Cell%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bif%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7Dr%5C%5Cbmod%202s%3D0%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bthen%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSend%7D%28%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%2Cr%2Bs%29%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Belse%20if%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7Dr%5C%5Cbmod%202s%3Ds%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bthen%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRecv%7D%28r-s%29%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20if%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%7D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbuf%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%22%7D"></card></p></figure></section>